jlcol
Plotting Colour
text101 8
ILCOL (3B) - colours for on-screen Eirene
             graphics
1 black  4 green     7 cyan
2 red    5 magenta   8 red
3 green  6 yellow

Colours 2 to 5 are used to plot the particle
trajectories
